   "source": [
    "## Section 18 — Feature interactions\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research question.** Do features matter only for particular profiles?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motivation.** Signals may be conditional on ability or task.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs.** student_features\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology.** Predefined candidates, fold-fitted representatives, OOF delta R², MI, conditional associations, Friedman H, partial dependence, optional SHAP.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configuration.** `interaction_candidates`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs.** interaction_results\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation.** No unrestricted all-pairs search.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations.** Multiplicity across candidates."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
