   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Section 19 — Experimental literacy indices\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research question.** Do interpretable composites help?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motivation.** Composites may be more stable and interpretable.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs.** student_features\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology.** L01–L15 with declared directions, train-fitted robust scaling, reliability, residual association, incremental CV, cross-school stability.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configuration.** `index_min_components`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs.** literacy_indices, literacy_index_report\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation.** Experimental constructs.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations.** irt_/ia_ components use EDA versions here (A14 is fold-fitted)."
   ]
  },
