   "source": [
    "## Section 20 — Predictive ablation\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research question.** Which modalities add predictive value?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motivation.** Controlled comparison of feature families.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs.** student_features, cv_assignments\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology.** A00–A23 under student and school-grouped CV, paired bootstrap deltas, leave-one-family-out, pairwise complementarity, nested forward selection, redundancy.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configuration.** `ablation_*`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs.** ablation_results, ablation_oof_predictions\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation.** Deltas with CIs, not single scores.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations.** Expensive in FULL mode."
