   "source": [
    "## Section 21 — Nested residual learning\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research question.** Does two-stage residual learning beat direct regression?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motivation.** Residual correction can isolate incremental acoustic value.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs.** student_features\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology.** Nested inner-OOF residual targets, inner-selected alpha, refit, outer evaluation; compared with direct and nested blending.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configuration.** `residual_fusion_alphas, inner_cv_folds`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs.** residual_learning_results\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation.** Alpha never sees outer outcomes.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations.** —"
   ]
