    "## Section 22 — Failure phenotype atlas\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research question.** Which students are hard to predict, and why?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motivation.** Failures point to missing information.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs.** OOF predictions\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology.** Failure registry, rule-based F01–F12 flags, empirical failure clusters, recovery by phenotype.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configuration.** `—`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs.** failure_registry, failure_summary\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation.** Descriptive, not diagnoses.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations.** Regression to the mean."
