    "## Section 23 — Foundation-model exploration (optional)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research question.** Do pretrained representations add information?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motivation.** Frozen encoders may capture complementary structure.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs.** audio, vad_segments\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology.** Licensed local frozen encoders, layer selection, mean/std/quantile/speech-active pooling, PCA, task/student pooling, OOM recovery.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configuration.** `enable_embeddings, embedding_models`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs.** embedding_student_features\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation.** Requires verified licence and overlap checks.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations.** Disabled by default."
